{"seq":1,"slug":"random-graph-models","title":"随机图模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/network-graph-analysis/models/random-graph-models","wordCount":1561,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"随机图模型\">随机图模型</h1><p>真实社交网络又抱团又有枢纽，可这背后到底是什么生成机制？回答这个问题，需要一个能「造图」的玩具：调几个参数，看它能不能长出和真实网络一样的 <a href=\"../metrics/structural-properties\">结构性质</a>。随机图模型就是这样的生成器。它把网络分析从「描述既有的图」推进到「解释图为何如此」，并同时提供了一个不可或缺的<strong>零模型</strong>——判断你观测到的社区、聚类、枢纽是真信号还是随机巧合的基准。这一篇讲四个经典模型各自能解释什么、不能解释什么。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>经典随机图模型可以按「它想复现哪个结构性质」来组织：纯随机基准、重尾度分布、小世界、以及保留特定约束的生成。下图展示这条脉络。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  RGM[随机图模型] --&gt; ER[Erdos-Renyi]&#10;  ER --&gt; BASELINE[纯随机基准/零模型]&#10;  RGM --&gt; BA[Barabasi-Albert]&#10;  BA --&gt; SCALEFREE[无标度/优先连接]&#10;  RGM --&gt; WS[Watts-Strogatz]&#10;  WS --&gt; SMALLWORLD[小世界]&#10;  RGM --&gt; CONFIG[配置模型]&#10;  CONFIG --&gt; KEEPDEG[保留度分布]&#10;  RGM --&gt; SBM[随机块模型]&#10;  SBM --&gt; KEEPCOMM[保留社区结构]\">graph TD\n  RGM[随机图模型] --&gt; ER[Erdos-Renyi]\n  ER --&gt; BASELINE[纯随机基准/零模型]\n  RGM --&gt; BA[Barabasi-Albert]\n  BA --&gt; SCALEFREE[无标度/优先连接]\n  RGM --&gt; WS[Watts-Strogatz]\n  WS --&gt; SMALLWORLD[小世界]\n  RGM --&gt; CONFIG[配置模型]\n  CONFIG --&gt; KEEPDEG[保留度分布]\n  RGM --&gt; SBM[随机块模型]\n  SBM --&gt; KEEPCOMM[保留社区结构]</pre><p>下表对照各模型的输入参数、它能复现的性质，以及它的主要局限。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>关键参数</th>\n<th>能复现</th>\n<th>主要局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Erdős–Rényi</td>\n<td>连边概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>短路径</td>\n<td>聚类低、度分布泊松</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Barabási–Albert</td>\n<td>每步连边数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>无标度度分布</td>\n<td>聚类偏低、无社区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Watts–Strogatz</td>\n<td>重连概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>小世界（短路径+高聚类）</td>\n<td>度分布不重尾</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置模型</td>\n<td>指定度序列</td>\n<td>任意度分布</td>\n<td>不控制聚类/社区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机块模型</td>\n<td>块间连边概率矩阵</td>\n<td>社区结构</td>\n<td>需预设块数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"erd-s-r-nyi-纯随机基准\">Erdős–Rényi：纯随机基准</h2><p>最朴素的随机图 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G(n, p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 由 Erdős 和 Rényi 提出：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个节点，每一对节点以独立概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 连边。它的度分布在大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 下近似泊松分布，期望度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(n-1)p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，平均路径长度随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 增长（很短），但聚类系数等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>（稀疏图里极低）。</p>\n<p>ER 模型最著名的结果是<strong>相变</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 越过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 这个临界点，图会突然涌现出一个覆盖大部分节点的巨型连通分量。它解释不了真实网络的高聚类和重尾度分布（对照 <a href=\"../metrics/structural-properties\">结构性质</a> 那张表），所以它几乎从不用来「建模」真实网络——它真正的价值是当<strong>零模型</strong>：任何在真实图上发现的结构，都要先问「在同规模 ER 图上是否也会随机出现」。<a href=\"../metrics/community-detection\">社区发现</a> 里强调过，算法连随机图都能「发现」社区，ER 正是检验它的标尺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"barab-si-albert-优先连接造枢纽\">Barabási–Albert：优先连接造枢纽</h2><p>ER 的致命短板是度分布太均匀，造不出枢纽。Barabási–Albert 模型用<strong>优先连接</strong>（preferential attachment）补上：图从小核开始，每步加入一个新节点，它连向已有节点的概率正比于那些节点当前的度——「富者愈富」。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>u</mi></munder><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Pi(v) = \\frac{k_v}{\\sum_u k_u}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3571em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个简单机制自发产生幂律度分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∼</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(k) \\sim k^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，正是 <a href=\"../metrics/structural-properties\">结构性质</a> 里无标度网络的成因。早进入的节点有更多时间积累连接，最终成为枢纽——这解释了为什么万维网、引文网络、蛋白质网络都有少数超级枢纽。BA 模型的局限是聚类系数仍偏低、且不自带社区结构，所以它解释「枢纽从哪来」很成功，解释「为什么抱团」就力不从心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"watts-strogatz-小世界的生成机制\">Watts–Strogatz：小世界的生成机制</h2><p>Watts–Strogatz 模型专门解释小世界：从一个规则环形网格出发（每个节点连最近的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 个邻居，聚类高但路径长），然后以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 把每条边的一端随机重连到别处。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时是纯规则网格，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时退化成接近 ER 的随机图。神奇的是，只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 取很小的值（比如 0.01），少量「长程捷径」就足以把平均路径长度骤降到接近随机图的水平，而聚类系数几乎不受影响——于是同时拥有短路径和高聚类，即 <a href=\"../metrics/structural-properties\">结构性质</a> 定义的小世界。这个模型用极简的方式说明：现实网络的「六度分隔」不需要精心设计，只要少数随机捷径就能实现。它的短板是度分布近似均匀，造不出无标度的重尾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"配置模型与随机块模型\">配置模型与随机块模型</h2><p>前三个模型各自只复现一个性质。当你需要更精确的零模型时，会用到两个更可控的生成器。</p>\n<p><strong>配置模型</strong>（configuration model）固定一个给定的<strong>度序列</strong>，然后在满足这些度的前提下随机连边。它的用途是做「保留度分布的零模型」——比如检验真实网络的某个特征是否仅仅由度分布决定。<a href=\"../metrics/community-detection\">社区发现</a> 里模块度公式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_i k_j / 2m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 期望项，本质就是配置模型的连边期望，这两篇在此处直接打通。</p>\n<p><strong>随机块模型</strong>（Stochastic Block Model, SBM）则反过来，专门生成带社区的图：把节点划成若干块，块内连边概率高、块间连边概率低，由一个概率矩阵控制。SBM 是社区发现的「生成对偶」——很多现代社区算法本质上是在做 SBM 的统计推断（拟合出最可能的块划分）。它也是检验社区发现算法的标准合成数据来源：先用 SBM 造一张已知社区结构的图，再看算法能否还原。这一点直接服务于 <a href=\"../practice/applications-pitfalls\">应用与陷阱</a> 里强调的「用合成数据验证管线」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>随机图模型从「描述」转向「生成与解释」，并提供判断结构是否真实的零模型。</li>\n<li>Erdős–Rényi 是纯随机基准，造短路径但聚类低、度分布泊松，主要价值是当零模型。</li>\n<li>Barabási–Albert 用优先连接「富者愈富」自发产生无标度幂律度分布，解释枢纽来源。</li>\n<li>Watts–Strogatz 用规则网格+少量随机重连解释小世界（短路径+高聚类）。</li>\n<li>配置模型保留指定度分布、是模块度期望项的来源；随机块模型生成带社区的图、是社区发现的生成对偶与验证工具。</li>\n<li>选模型取决于你要复现或控制哪个 <a href=\"../metrics/structural-properties\">结构性质</a>；它们也是 <a href=\"link-prediction\">链接预测</a> 与 <a href=\"../practice/applications-pitfalls\">应用与陷阱</a> 的基准。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"随机图模型","id":"随机图模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Erdős–Rényi：纯随机基准","id":"erd-s-r-nyi-纯随机基准"},{"level":2,"text":"Barabási–Albert：优先连接造枢纽","id":"barab-si-albert-优先连接造枢纽"},{"level":2,"text":"Watts–Strogatz：小世界的生成机制","id":"watts-strogatz-小世界的生成机制"},{"level":2,"text":"配置模型与随机块模型","id":"配置模型与随机块模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"结构性质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/network-graph-analysis/metrics/structural-properties"},"next":{"title":"链接预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/network-graph-analysis/models/link-prediction"}}